## User Requirements

### UR-01: Skill Level Calibration
The playbook must be usable by:
- C++ beginner (knows Python/JavaScript well)
- Basic C++ theory (knows concepts, not fluent)
- No JUCE framework experience
- No DSP implementation experience
- Strong VST usage experience as musician

### UR-02: Creative Direction
The playbook must respect:
- Human makes all sound identity decisions
- Human approves all GUI aesthetics
- Human names all presets
- AI proposes options, never single defaults

### UR-03: Reproducibility
Another developer with similar skills should be able to:
- Follow the playbook to produce comparable results
- Understand all decisions from documentation
- Build on knowledge base for future projects

